02:54.680 --> 02:55.430
Tidak.

02:56.240 --> 02:58.030
Awak hanya memikirkan keadilan dunia setiap hari.

02:58.280 --> 02:59.560
Kami adik-beradik

02:59.680 --> 03:00.590
